WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.910
I caused you all a great deal of trouble yesterday.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.780
I apologize.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.410
As you can see, the princess is deeply sorry for her actions.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:20.690
I implore you to forgive her.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.260
Sure...

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.570
Please, accept this.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.200
Let me take a bite!

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:40.210
No, I wanna have the first bite!

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:44.460
I hope that this incident will not cause you to prohibit any further visits by the princess.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:49.670
Well, about that...

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:50.860
Wait, huh?

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.470
We beseech you.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:53.970
You will do it, no?

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.630
E-Excuse me?

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:56.610
This!

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.730
A sequel to this!

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.250
Could you possibly?

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.230
Can you draw it?

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.280
Oh, come on!

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.980
Not you guys, too!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.540
Hey, Oshutoru.

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:40.290
What is it?

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.030
Do I really have to wear this?

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.770
Of course.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:52.050
{This is the Imperial Court}{Royal/Divine Court??????}{Seijou - a title for divine person}{and you have an audience with the Emperor.}{CR fucking please}You have an audience with His Majesty the Emperor.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.590
Well, that's the thing.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:57.240
Why does the Emperor want to meet me?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.230
Your guess is as good as mine.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.930
Jeez, give me a break.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.030
Beyond this lies the audience hall,

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.680
where the Emperor awaits.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.550
Past this point,

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.940
you should exercise prudence with your words.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.450
Follow after me.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.600
Uh... Right.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:23.960
I pray the day finds you well, my Emperor.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:30.620
I, Oshutoru, have brought to you Master Haku, 
the man you wished to see.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:32.260
Not yet.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.130
So you are Haku?

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.760
Raise your head.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.230
<i>So that's the Emperor?</i>

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:53.240
I've been told you saved my daughter, Anju, when she was kidnapped by bandits.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.710
It is so.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.740
<i>Oh, so that's what this is about.</i>

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.740
<i>Looks like Munechika handled the explanation well.</i>

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:03.750
I'm told you performed commendably.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.000
Huh?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:12.990
With great cunning, you captured all 
the bandits in a single instant.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.010
It was truly impressive, I'm told.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:18.010
<i>She laid it on too thick!</i>

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.510
Impressive indeed.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.590
Your efforts shall be rewarded.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:24.040
Th-Thank you.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:27.600
<i>Oh, man... I'm not important enough 
to deserve any kind of reward...</i>

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.860
Honoka, bring them here.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.270
Honoka?

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:30.940
At once.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.030
<i>Honoka-san?</i>

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:38.660
<i>W-Wait... Don't tell me the Emperor's...</i>

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:46.760
Master Haku.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.460
S-Sorry, I couldn't help it.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:51.210
It is fine.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:55.120
You truly say the most interesting things.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:58.220
Perhaps you once viewed a portrait of me.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:04.790
O-Oh... Y-Yeah, that sounds likely!

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:09.230
<i>What's going on with that old guy?</i>

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.360
Now then, Honoka.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.920
As you wish.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.880
<i>Who are these two?</i>

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.170
These two are your reward.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.040
Huh?

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.880
Uruuru.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.550
I am Saraana.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:24.050
As a symbol of our vow, 
we relinquish to you here...{orig: This is the sign of our vow,
that we give you here...}

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.680
...the entirety of our beings.{...everything that we are.}

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:29.750
We are the Kamunagi of Chains,

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.190
and we swear eternal loyalty to you, our lord and master.{I am in 200% fantasy mode}

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:40.190
As of this moment, they belong to you.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.320
Their bodies, their souls, their very existences.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.570
What!?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:48.180
They will accept any order you give them.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.170
You may treat them as objects to be admired,

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.750
or as playthings to entertain yourself.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.580
All shall be allowed.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.840
No, wait a second!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.590
That is all.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:05.090
Farewell, Haku.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:09.370
I look forward to our next encounter.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.600
Take good care of my daughters, please.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.690
Wh-What is the meaning of this!?

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:31.570
How can someone of such lowly descent be given the Kamunagi of Chains?

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.870
This must be some mistake!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.410
Double-check this now!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:40.180
Now! Now!

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.180
Silence!

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:48.260
You are perfectly aware of the meaning behind those words, are you not?

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:54.210
To challenge so directly the will of our Emperor...

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:56.520
Have you lost your senses?

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:04.020
The Emperor's acts surely follow 
a design beyond our comprehension.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.500
Let us retire, Master Haku.

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.240
Posthaste, if possible.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.460
R-Right.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.650
"Haku," {his name was}was it?

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.040
Just who is he?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.920
Oshutoru's right-hand man, 
according to the reports.

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:29.970
Certainly, he's far keener a blade than cursory glances would suggest.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.080
Intriguing.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:34.930
I'm back.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.610
It's good to see you again{back}, Haku-sama.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:38.940
Welcome back.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:41.190
What did Oshutoru want?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.410
You look real tired.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.140
Still cleanin' them gutters?

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:49.200
Nah, I got summoned to the palace.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:50.190
Huh?

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.630
The palace?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.650
Whatever for?

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.950
Did you meet the Emperor or something?

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.700
Yeah, right!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.710
Yup, I did. Emperor and all.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.000
Told you!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.140
You can't just show up and ask to see the...

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:04.710
Huh!?

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.710
What!?

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.410
Wh-What do you mean?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.290
It's a long story, but...

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.250
U-Um, Haku-sama...

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:20.920
I've been wondering...

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:23.230
Who are those two?

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:27.760
Who are they?

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.240
Guests o' yours?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:33.280
Oh, these two?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.440
We are our master's objects.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:40.170
We have become but carnal dolls for our master.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.270
We are Uruuru...

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.520
...and Saraana.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:44.480
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.380
From morning to night...

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.760
The bed, the bath, even the toilet...

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:56.860
We shall take care of everything.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.270
W-Wait, wait!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.770
Now there's even more...

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.750
How filthy.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:08.280
Hey, when did you leave me in the dust and climb the stairs of adulthood, mister?

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:09.980
No, wait!

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.780
I didn't want to bring them!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.930
The Emperor <i>personally</i> gave them to me!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:16.760
I can't exactly turn that down, you know!

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:22.520
But is this okay with you two?

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.420
I know you may not have had a choice,

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.790
but if you don't want to do this,

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:29.050
tell us and we'll help out.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.590
Our existence has one purpose...

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:35.300
To accept everything that our master offers.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.920
For that alone, we exist.

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:41.310
Everythin', you say?

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.810
This... or that...

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:50.570
We shall connect with our master in every way possible.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.090
Rurutie!

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:08.990
Wake up, Rurutie! Rurutie!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.660
<i>Why...</i>

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.990
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.010
Hey, Kuon?

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.670
Do I just put it on this shelf?

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.260
Yeah, thanks.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.980
Neko-yan, Neko-yan,

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:21.400
you caught a glimpse of my 
hairpiece 'round here or no?

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:25.650
Oh, I just saw it nearby.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.480
I see.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:33.170
When presented with a situation beyond their comprehension,

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:36.110
