00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:37.740
No! No!

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:40.130
I can't let Nekone-san see this.

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:43.370
She's putting her hand <i>there</i>?

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:47.210
Goodness. Popular aren't we, Haku-san?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.380
