00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:55.900
Here, Master.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.140
We've made some tea.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.030
Mouth-to-mouth.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.200
{You spilled some.}A dirty surprise.{"okuchi yogoshi" is something you say when you're giving someone higher rank something cheap. it means something like "Here is something to dirty (occupy?) your mouth for the time being"}

