00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.930
We have mastered the 108 techniques.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.440
N-No!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.690
Th-That's my job!

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:53.210
Accompanying him in bed?

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.690
So that has been your responsibility until now?

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:58.700
I-I meant the cooking!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.560
Hey, Rurutie!

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:01.590
Calm down!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.750
Haku-sama,

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.400
