00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.220
Stay there.

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.230
We will clean you.

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.600
W-Wait a minute!

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.420
You don't have to do that—

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.450
It's dripping.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.510
It's soaked down here, too.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:37.240
