00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:41.160
Strip him.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.140
We will remove your clothes.

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:43.830
Stop it!

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:45.120
No more!

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:46.890
Look, everyone, it's not like that!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:47.760
It's not!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.000
So don't look at me like that!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.500
Absolutely filthy.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:57.500
Amanoyahegumo, fukihanatsu koto no gotoku.{a line from this poem: http://www.geocities.jp/sizen_junnosuke/ooharahinnokotoba.html}{lit. "As if to blow away many layers of clouds"}

