00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:51.910
Hiss! Hiss! Hiss!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:52.490
Hiss! Hiss! Hiss!

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:53.770
What?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.240
Neko-yan's so silly.

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.470
Oh, so that's how it is.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.500
Explains a lot.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:03.030
I guess it makes sense,
if that's who you really are.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.460
Hey, guys!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.460
Kept you waiting, huh?

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.260
Having fun, Sacchan?

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.010
Sure am, Ucchan!

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:22.520
So, Ukon, we never did finish our 
match from the tournament.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:27.400
The place collapsed before we could finish.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.280
What, you wanna go outside and duke it out?

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.010
Interesting.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:36.530
Today, let's settle the question of who's stronger once and for all.

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:38.830
Hey, knock it off.

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:41.290
Do you <i>want</i> to demolish our home?

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:44.630
He's got a point.

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:51.010
Then tonight, you come join us and 
we'll have a drinking contest!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:53.800
So Ukon and Sakon are Oshutoru and Mikazuchi?

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.560
But it's kind of nice...

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.680
That's right.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.330
They're always competing 
with each other like that.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.800
And it's because they recognize 
one another's strength.

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:11.900
<i>N-No!</i>

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.820
<i>Ukon-sama already has Haku-sama!</i>

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:21.330
But it's hard to deny the allure of this pairing too!

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.060
We've put them to bed.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:30.090
We walked Nekone-sama and 
Kiuru-sama to their beds.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.150
Okay. Thanks, you two.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.590
The Kamunagi of Chains, huh?

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.850
Come to think of it, 
that's what they called themselves.

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:41.970
Just who exactly are they?

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.650
Long story short, they're priestesses.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:47.480
But they're also more than that.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.590
They're the daughters of
High Priestess Honoka-sama,

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:52.140
and her heirs.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.850
<i>The High Priestess?</i>

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.620
<i>She was that important?</i>

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:03.730
Who knows why he'd give those 
two to someone like you?

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:04.760
Yeah, why?

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:05.970
Beats me.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:11.610
The Emperor's thoughts are 
beyond our comprehension.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:17.720
Still, the Emperor has recognized your talents.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.140
That's one thing we can be sure of.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.180
I don't really get it,

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.290
but I hope this doesn't end up biting me in the end.

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:31.210
Anyway, this place has gotten pretty crowded.

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:34.060
That's true.

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:38.030
But all those connections were forged by you.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:39.370
Connections?

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:40.030
Yup.

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:45.200
They've all gathered here around you.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:47.750
Is that how it works?

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.720
It is.

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:57.250
I can't wait to see what you're
going to do from here on.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:21:00.800
Don't get your hopes up too much...

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.440
Don't worry.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:06.810
You can just keep being yourself.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.050
Being myself, huh?

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.190
That's right.

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.210
We're going to keep on doing what we want.

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:17.440
Am I right, Sacchan?

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.450
Right you are, Ucchan.

00:22:55.950 --> 00:22:57.190
I see.

00:22:57.190 --> 00:22:59.080
So Maruruha has fallen?

00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:00.460
Yes.

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:04.410
The Uzuurussha forces have 
crossed the border, I'm told,

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:07.350
and invaded Yamato.

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:09.270
Foolish barbarians...

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:12.100
They would attack Yamato?

00:23:13.020 --> 00:23:16.300
My Emperor! Your orders!

00:23:19.220 --> 00:23:20.980
My men...

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:26.240
I permit the use of your power, the Akuruka.

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:29.240
Slaughter these pathetic barbarians to the last.

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:35.250
Let those who would dare commit the sin of transgression face our punishment!{orig: Punish them for the sin of 
refusing to know their place!}
